{"id":12535,"author":"SirSavi","body":"\u003cdiv id=\"gt-src-c\" class=\"g-unit\"\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"gt-src-p\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"\" id=\"gt-src-wrap\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003ctextarea class=\"goog-textarea\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-y: hidden; overflow-x: auto; padding-right: 20px; height: 220px; padding-bottom: 32px;\" id=\"source\" name=\"text\" tabindex=\"0\" dir=\"ltr\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocomplete=\"off\" wrap=\"SOFT\"\u003e\u003c/textarea\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"display: inline-block;\" id=\"gt-input-tool\"\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"itamenu\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ita-kd-inputtools-div\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"gt-src-c\" class=\"g-unit\"\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"gt-src-p\"\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv id=\"gt-res-content\" class=\"almost_half_cell\"\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" style=\"zoom:1\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"result_box\" class=\"\" lang=\"en\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eHello\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003emoderators,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eyou\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003epractically\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ehave\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ebanned\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eme\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003efor stealing\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ea map\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, okay\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eno problem,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ebut we had\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eno idea\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ethat map\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, we only use\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ethe basis\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eof the\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003emap\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ewhat\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ehappens now\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eis that they should\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003enot\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ebe banned\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eforever,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ea kick or\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ea ban\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003etemp\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003e..\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003edo not know\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003e..\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eI'm just saying\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, you should\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003econsider it.\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eBecause at least\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eI have\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eno infringement\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eeh\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003enever\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ebroken the rules\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, other than\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eit is.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eI have a\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003epurchased\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003erange\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eeh\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003econtributed\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eto the community.\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eAnd just for\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ebeing\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003ewrong\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u003eshould not be\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"hps\"\u0